{"id":49675,"date":"2026-08-07T15:52:15","date_gmt":"2026-08-07T14:52:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=49675"},"modified":"2026-08-23T17:29:28","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T16:29:28","slug":"maratona-de-sevilha-2026","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-sevilha-2026\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Sevilha 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"49675\" class=\"elementor elementor-49675\" data-elementor-post-type=\"ajde_events\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f93804 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0f93804\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c4fdbf1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"c4fdbf1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A <strong>Zurich Marat\u00f3n de Sevilla 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na cidade de <strong>Sevilha, Espanha<\/strong>, com a sua pr\u00f3xima edi\u00e7\u00e3o confirmada para o dia <strong>15 de fevereiro de 2026<\/strong>. Trata-se de uma prova de <strong>estrada<\/strong> com a dist\u00e2ncia cl\u00e1ssica de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong>, sendo amplamente reconhecida pela comunidade atl\u00e9tica global. Realizada anualmente no m\u00eas de <strong>fevereiro<\/strong>, o seu principal &#8220;selling point&#8221; \u00e9 possuir o <strong>percurso mais plano da Europa<\/strong>, o que, aliado \u00e0 baixa altitude e prote\u00e7\u00e3o contra o vento, a torna o cen\u00e1rio predileto para corredores que procuram estabelecer recordes pessoais ou obter marcas de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o para grandes campeonatos internacionais. O trajeto \u00e9 um deleite visual, atravessando o centro hist\u00f3rico e passando por monumentos emblem\u00e1ticos como a Giralda, a Torre del Oro e o Parque de Mar\u00eda Luisa.<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":20409,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,31],"event_type_2":[809,627],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-49675","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-sevilha-espanha","event_type-corrida","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-espanha","event_type_2-europa"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/306780755_453755366779783_6669253230259471057_n.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/49675","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=49675"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/49675\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":61354,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/49675\/revisions\/61354"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/20409"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=49675"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=49675"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunn